# Xcode / SwiftPM build artifacts. The .xcodeproj is XcodeGen-generated, NOT
# committed — `xcodegen generate` is a required first step after cloning.
# Policy rationale: companion-ios/CLAUDE.md.
*.xcodeproj/

## Build output
build/
DerivedData/
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
*.dSYM

## Xcode per-user state (would live inside a generated .xcodeproj)
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xccheckout

## SwiftPM
.build/
Packages/*/.build/
.swiftpm/xcode/package.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
.swiftpm/xcode/xcuserdata/

## Misc
.DS_Store
*.moved-aside
*.hmap

# Native map styles are generated from the shared planner palette.
Packages/OBCKit/Sources/OBCUI/Resources/Map/light.json
Packages/OBCKit/Sources/OBCUI/Resources/Map/dark.json

Packages/OBCKit/Sources/OBCUI/Resources/Map/poi-kinds.json
